SUMMARY:Haywood Grows Farm Fest and 'Mater Mayhem ft. Angela Easterling + Jon Shain and FJ Ventre
DESCRIPTION:We hope you’ll join us next Saturday August 1st at Sorrells Park in Canton for the first annual Haywood Grows Farm Fest featuring ‘Mater Mayhem! Free fun for the whole family featuring live music\, bouncy houses\, fun contests\, the Cool Cucumber Corner sensory tent\, petting zoo\, and of course ‘MATER SANDWICHES! Come spend the day and celebrate with us! https://www.haywoodgrowsfarmfest.com/
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/haywood-grows-farm-fest-and-mater-mayhem-ft-angela-easterling-jon-shain-and-fj-ventre/
LOCATION:Sorrells Park\, Downtown Canton
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
