SUMMARY:Kingfisher Folk Fest
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Canongate Catholic High School’s annual Kingfisher Folk Fest\, a day of music\, dancing\, crafts\, kids’ activities\, food and drink.Saturday\, August 1st 12-8 PM at the beautiful venue\, The Oaks at Daniel Ridge\, located at 818 Monte Vista Rd\, Candler\, NC 28715.\nTickets from $25 and event datails:  https://kingfisherfest.rsvpify.com/
